	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><p><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/fkce/fkce2.jpg" alt="FKCE" width="850" height="413" /></p>
<hr />
<table class="ou-two-columns-2-1"><caption>Two Columns (2:1 Split)</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Column</th>
<th>Column</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>The Foster and Kinship Care Education (FKCE) program at Lake Tahoe Community College offers FREE classes and trainings for current and prospective Resource Families (foster care and kinship care, relative or non-relative) who live in South Lake Tahoe. Our programs are designed to engage and educate Resource Families so they are able to meet the educational, emotional, behavioral and developmental needs of children and youth. The training topics we offer cover a wide range of subjects, with a focus on Trauma, Resource Family Approval (formerly Foster Family), and support and training for Kinship Providers.</p>
</td>
<td>
<table class="ou-form-block"><caption>Form Section</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th>Textual Content</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<h3>Contact</h3>
<hr />
<p><strong>Dana McKnight-Flentroy</strong><br />FKCE Program Director<br />(530) 541-4660 x 528<br /><a href="mailto:mcknight@ltcc.edu">mcknight@ltcc.edu</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>Form Asset</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
<div class="3columnareaofstudysnippet" style="background-color: #edf2f5; padding-bottom: 25px;"><br /><br />
<div class="row" data-equalizer="">
<div class="large-4 medium-4 small-12 columns ctnt_blk updatectnt_blk">
<div class="div_hover_link" style="background-image: url('https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/specialized_programs/_resources/images/whitebox2.png'); background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat; height: 250px !important; width: 97%; display: block; margin: 0 auto;" title="Forms"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/icons/formsicon_250.jpg" alt="Forms icon" width="250" height="250" /></div>
<br />
<div class="content_div_panel" data-equalizer-watch="">
<div class="content_headerandparagraph"><span class="snippettitle" style="text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14pt;">Forms</span><br /><br /></div>
<div class="content_headerandparagraph">Please review and complete the appropriate forms to participate and complete coursework:</div>
</div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore"><a class="areasOfStudy3LearnMoreLink" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/pdfs/fkce/release_of_caregiver_info_2020.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Release of Caregiver Information &rarr;</a></div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore"><a class="areasOfStudy3LearnMoreLink" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/pdfs/fkce/eng_2019_20_fkce_partic_reg.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Participant Registration &rarr;</a></div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore"><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/pdfs/fkce/sp_2019_20_fkce_partic_reg.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formulario de Registro de Participante &rarr;</a></div>
</div>
<div class="large-4 medium-4 small-12 columns ctnt_blk updatectnt_blk">
<div class="div_hover_link" style="background-image: url('https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/specialized_programs/_resources/images/whitebox2.png'); background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat; height: 250px !important; width: 97%; display: block; margin: 0 auto;" title="Highlighted Resources"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/icons/videoicon_250.jpg" alt="Video Icon" width="250" height="250" /></div>
<br />
<div class="content_div_panel" data-equalizer-watch="">
<div class="content_headerandparagraph"><span class="snippettitle" style="text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14pt;">Highlighted Resources</span></div>
<div class="content_headerandparagraph">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="content_headerandparagraph">We would like to bring awareness to traumatic brain injury and shaken baby syndrome. Here are some informative videos in hopes of preventing the devastating, lifelong impact on infants and children:</div>
</div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore"><a href="https://youtu.be/5nBqLwg2Eug" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Brain Concussion: Shake It and You Break It &rarr;</a></div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore"><a href="https://youtu.be/t9vH6tqwxg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Forever Shaken &mdash; Brain Injury Nebraska &rarr;</a></div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore"><a href="https://youtu.be/LfpSTTeSmk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shaken Baby Syndrome: Science vs. Myth &rarr;</a></div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore"><a href="https://youtu.be/MfvirvbxbfE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Michael: The Story of Shaken Baby Documentary &rarr;</a></div>
</div>
<div class="large-4 medium-4 small-12 columns ctnt_blk updatectnt_blk">
<div class="div_hover_link" style="background-image: url('https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/specialized_programs/_resources/images/whitebox2.png'); background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat; height: 250px !important; width: 97%; display: block; margin: 0 auto;" title="ZOOM Information"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/zoom250.jpg" alt="Zoom Logo" width="250" height="250" /></div>
<br />
<div class="content_div_panel" data-equalizer-watch="">
<div class="content_headerandparagraph"><span class="snippettitle" style="text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14pt;">ZOOM Information</span><br /><br /></div>
<div class="content_headerandparagraph">
<p>We look forward to providing you with our Foster and Kinship Care Education training in a live online environment via Zoom.</p>
<p>Here are the requirements of your participation in order to receive credit/certification:</p>
</div>
<div class="content_headerandparagraph">Zoom Guidelines:</div>
<div class="content_headerandparagraph" style="padding-left: 30px;"><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/pdfs/fkce/eng_zoomguidelines_ltcc.docx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">English</a> | <a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/pdfs/fkce/spanish_zoomguidelines_ltcc.docx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Spanish</a></div>
</div>
<div class="areasOfStudy3LearnMore"><a class="areasOfStudy3LearnMoreLink" href="https://zoom.us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download Zoom &rarr;</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<hr />
<h4>Resource Family Approval</h4>
<p>The state of California has implemented a variety of changes to help streamline the process of becoming a foster parent that are both family-friendly and child-centered. Pre-service training based on the newly implemented process is available at LTCC. Please contact <a href="mailto:mcknight@ltcc.edu?subject=FKCE%20Inquiry%20from%20the%20Website">Dana McKnight</a> for more information or to register for classes.</p>
<hr />
